# Shared by every build that uses the repository root as its context -
# the agent image AND `docker compose build api`. So this excludes only
# what NEITHER image needs: the customer's data, the frontend, test
# material. `apps/api/src` is deliberately not here, because the API image
# is built from this same context and would lose its own source.
